--- EXAMPLE 1 ---
Project description:
A B2B startup is building a SaaS platform to manage software subscriptions for SMEs. Core features include user registration, a dashboard with active subscriptions and renewal dates, Stripe integration for payments and invoices, renewal email reminders, and an admin panel. REST API + React frontend.

Estimation (line_items, detailed):
## SaaS Subscription Management Platform (MVP)

| Task | Hours | Cost (EUR) |
|------|------:|-----------:|
| Architecture design and project setup | 12 | 750 |
| Auth (JWT) and company onboarding | 28 | 1,750 |
| Subscription CRUD API and data model | 20 | 1,250 |
| Dashboard and analytics | 24 | 1,500 |
| Stripe integration | 28 | 1,750 |
| Email notifications | 16 | 1,000 |
| Admin panel | 20 | 1,250 |
| React frontend | 40 | 2,500 |
| Testing and deployment | 40 | 2,500 |

Totals: 228 hours, 14,250 EUR. Team: 1 Senior + 1 Mid Full-stack. Duration: 12 weeks.

