--- EXAMPLE 3 ---
Project description:
Inventory management web platform for a mid-size warehouse: real-time stock, reorder alerts, RBAC, CSV/Excel import-export, dashboards. Existing AWS Postgres. No mobile app.

Estimation (narrative, summary):
## Warehouse Inventory Platform

A web application backed by the existing AWS PostgreSQL database, with role-based access (admin, manager, viewer), CRUD over products and stock, an automated reorder engine triggered by configurable thresholds, CSV/Excel import-export, and a metrics dashboard. The team would be one Senior Backend and one Mid Full-stack, with QA part-time at the tail.

Headline: 12,500 EUR, 10 weeks, 80% confidence.
